Mnemo is an independent implementation. It contains no code from Anki (AGPL-3.0).
Scheduling algorithms are written from public descriptions (SuperMemo SM-2, Leitner
system); FSRS is provided by the ts-fsrs library (MIT). The `{{c1::...}}` cloze syntax
is supported for interoperability.

